WEBVTT

00:24:27.651 --> 00:24:30.307
I was struggling to get my research
accepted in journals

00:24:30.331 --> 00:24:32.776
and to feel accepted
by my new classmates.

00:24:32.800 --> 00:24:35.716
Sitting alone at my desk
over the December holidays,

00:24:35.740 --> 00:24:39.316
feeling isolated in the midst
of a cold, gray, Michigan winter,

00:24:39.340 --> 00:24:42.863
I made a list of the 100 people
who mattered most in my life

00:24:42.887 --> 00:24:44.157
and sent them each a note,

00:24:44.181 --> 00:24:46.795
telling them what I appreciated
most about them.

00:24:47.370 --> 00:24:49.761
Suddenly, I didn't feel alone anymore.

00:24:50.666 --> 00:24:54.386
Looking back, 100 emails in one week
was a little intense.

00:24:54.410 --> 00:24:55.561
But to this day,

00:24:55.585 --> 00:24:58.162
it's one of the most meaningful things
I've ever done.

00:24:58.186 --> 00:25:00.415
I learned that it doesn't take
a lot of effort